		(property "Design_note" "SOP-24 without exposed pad; I2C address 0x54; I2C and SDB on the private supply-following domain. R7 = 12 k limits the nominal peak LED current to 6.3375 mA per channel; long-term thermal behaviour not yet characterised. SDB tied to SYS_5V (underlighting shutdown is by I2C register; BCM7 is used for programming)."
			(at 63.5 107.95 0)
